- Byrne RA, et al. 2023 ESC Guidelines for the management of acute coronary syndromes. Eur Heart J 2023.
- Rautaharju PM, et al. AHA/ACCF/HRS Recommendations for the Standardization and Interpretation of the ECG, Part IV (ST, T, U waves and QT). Circulation 2009.
- Resuscitation Council UK / ERC Guidelines 2021 — Adult Advanced Life Support (tachycardia & bradycardia algorithms).
- Hampton J. The ECG Made Easy, latest edition.
- Harrison's Principles of Internal Medicine, 21st Ed — Electrocardiography.
